  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Transparencia y Lucha contra la Corrupcin</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transparency and Anticorruption Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Al apoyar en acciones prioritarias de la polticas de lucha contra la corrupcin del Gobierno Boliviano se espera reducir los niveles de corrupcin en la administracin pblica boliviana y mejorar de esta manera la percepcin de los niveles de corrupcin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By supporting the actions that the government of Bolivia has prioritized in the fight against corruption, it is expected to reduce the levels and therefore the perception of corruption in the public administration.</narrative>
  </description>
